{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1386561-new-community-content-the-mantles-of-washington","id":1386561,"title":"New Community Content: The Mantles of Washington","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-05-07T17:13:02-07:00","id":1386561,"title":"New Community Content: The Mantles of Washington","content":"I did the layout for this one! <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/312878/Mantles-of-Washington?affiliate_id=498510\" target=\"_blank\">Check it out! </a><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>The Mantles of Washington</b> explores the real-world divine mantles of George Washington, the Founding Father of the United States of America, and makes them available for your Scion campaigns! Inthis detailed supplement, learn about the divine mantles of the First President, discover a new America-focused religion, and much more.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">This product includes: </span></span></span><ul><li>Three mantles of George Washington (Kami, Orenda, and Theoi) worshiped in our world and mechanically imported for Scion play along with one additional mantle developed specifically for Scion</li> <li>A new religion, the American Civic Religion, to add flavor to your campaigns</li> <li>A slew of birthrights related to the First President for Scions to use in their journeys</li> <li>A new Calling, Revolutionary, with ten new knacks to enhance play</li> </ul> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-07T18:40:45-07:00","id":1386584,"title":"","content":"It makes sense, George Washington is a religious figure in our reality. Any plans for Franklin or Lincoln?<br /> <br /> Oh, for those that don't think Washington is actually worshiped in our world. Look up the Seneca religious leader Handsome Lake.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":857,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","user":"Astromancer","date":". 05-07-2020, 09:44 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-08T06:21:09-07:00","id":1386671,"title":"","content":"I love the divinity writeup, but i think the Star of this book is the new Calling. Definitely has a lot of potential, and I may include it in future games","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-08T07:11:11-07:00","id":1386681,"title":"","content":"This is really great, and I highly recommend it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Neall Raemonn Price</span><br /> Beleaguered Scion Developer</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/137-neall","name":"Neall","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1204"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-08T10:24:33-07:00","id":1386734,"title":"","content":"I like how it immediately addresses the controversy of making famous or historical figures, scions and gods. I have no problem doing this sparingly. A lot of historical figures, like Washington, have so much mythology and folklore surrounding them its hard not to see them in a Scion like view. In my game I have Washington as a Scion of Columbia, but I think this has convinced me to upgrade him to full deity. Out of all of the Founding Fathers he is definitely the one who fits the bill of Scion the most. The only other Founding Father I have as a Scion is Franklin as a Scion of Athena. Of course Adams is a Saint. I left Jefferson completely mortal, the man would scoff at the idea of being a Saint or Scion.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12488-jeremysbrain","name":"Jeremysbrain","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"209"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-08T14:31:40-07:00","id":1386779,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jeremysbrain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1386561-new-community-content-the-mantles-of-washington?p=1386734#post1386734\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I like how it immediately addresses the controversy of making famous or historical figures, scions and gods. I have no problem doing this sparingly. A lot of historical figures, like Washington, have so much mythology and folklore surrounding them its hard not to see them in a Scion like view. In my game I have Washington as a Scion of Columbia, but I think this has convinced me to upgrade him to full deity. Out of all of the Founding Fathers he is definitely the one who fits the bill of Scion the most. The only other Founding Father I have as a Scion is Franklin as a Scion of Athena. Of course Adams is a Saint. I left Jefferson completely mortal, the man would scoff at the idea of being a Saint or Scion.</div> </div> </div> </div>Washington don't need to be a Scion to become a Mantle, that's one thing that has changed from 1st to 2nd edition.<br /> <br /> The Founding Fathers can become Mantles other gods use as they represent a close connection to their purview. I mean, Columbia can be a Mantle of Athena for example, as Columbia was never a real person to start, same for (YES I WILL USE HIM) Uncle San that can be a Mantle of Ares (actually much close to Mars, but both are mantles) calling the younglings to an worth war for their freedom.<br /> <br /> The concept of the First President as a Hero started after the Independence, they were no Founding Father before funding anything, and even after, they were still people, not different form other people (with personality issues and prejudices, as most people in the time... and latter), but later the Americans created the great concept of the Funding Fathers, as they did for the peregrines, and the good (and savage) indians.<br /> <br /> The concept evolved and opened a &quot;god spot&quot; to be occupied, a Mantle to be used by a worth god.<br /> <br /> The spirits of the revolutionaries are in the underworld they deserve (what ever it is), but their legacy is lager than life.<br /> <br /> It's much like Divus Caesar, that are the collective of all the dead Caesars, not Gaius Julius Caesar, the person. None of the Roman Emperors deserved the title of a god, but them together build (and destroyed, in a certain way) an empire that changed forever the occidental world.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-08T15:01:23-07:00","id":1386787,"title":"","content":"Great now I need to swap out a Calling on my Lucifer writeup! *shakes fist at Heaven*","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-08T16:23:59-07:00","id":1386810,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Astromancer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1386561-new-community-content-the-mantles-of-washington?p=1386584#post1386584\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It makes sense, George Washington is a religious figure in our reality. Any plans for Franklin or Lincoln?<br /> <br /> Oh, for those that don't think Washington is actually worshiped in our world. Look up the Seneca religious leader Handsome Lake.</div> </div> </div> </div>I\u2019m not aware of them being overtly deified the same way. In the American Civic religion sense, yes Lincoln is on par with Washington, but in terms of literal deified portrayal and worship I\u2019m not familiar with it the same way Washington has.<br /> <br /> Edit: Ah I see he is deified as a Kami at the Daijingu Shrine in Hawaii with Washington (as are several native Hawaiian figures like King Kamehameha and Queen Liliulukalani)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 05-08-2020, 07:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}